Namely, $T$ is proper over $k$ (being closed in $X$) and affine (being closed in the affine scheme $X \setminus Y$, see Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/0EKE" data-tag="0EKE">29.44.18</a>) and hence finite over $k$ (Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01WN" data-tag="01WN">29.45.11</a>). Thus $T$ is a finite set of closed points.